UNSW-NB15 Dataset

Source:
Australian Centre for Cyber Security (ACCS), University of New South Wales

Description:
UNSW-NB15 is a network intrusion detection dataset containing both normal network traffic and simulated cyberattacks. Each row represents a network connection and includes features describing protocol information, packet statistics, connection duration, and traffic behavior.

Target Variable:
label

    0 = Normal Traffic
    1 = Attack Traffic

Column Descriptions:

srcip               Source IP address
sport               Source port number
dstip               Destination IP address
dsport              Destination port number
proto               Network protocol (TCP, UDP, etc.)
state               Connection state
dur                 Connection duration
sbytes              Bytes sent from source to destination
dbytes              Bytes sent from destination to source
sttl                Source Time-To-Live value
dttl                Destination Time-To-Live value
sloss               Source packet loss count
dloss               Destination packet loss count
service             Network service (HTTP, DNS, FTP, etc.)
Sload               Source bits per second
Dload               Destination bits per second
Spkts               Source packet count
Dpkts               Destination packet count
swin                Source TCP window size
dwin                Destination TCP window size
stcpb               Source TCP sequence number
dtcpb               Destination TCP sequence number
smeansz             Average source packet size
dmeansz             Average destination packet size
trans_depth         HTTP transaction depth
res_bdy_len         HTTP response body length
Sjit                Source packet jitter
Djit                Destination packet jitter
Stime               Connection start time
Ltime               Connection end time
Sintpkt             Average source packet interval
Dintpkt             Average destination packet interval
tcprtt              TCP round-trip time
synack              SYN-ACK response time
ackdat              ACK response time
is_sm_ips_ports     Source and destination IP/port match flag
ct_state_ttl        Connections with same state and TTL
ct_flw_http_mthd    HTTP method count
is_ftp_login        FTP login success indicator
ct_ftp_cmd          FTP command count
ct_srv_src          Connections to same service from source
ct_srv_dst          Connections to same service to destination
ct_dst_ltm          Connections to destination in recent window
ct_src_ltm          Connections from source in recent window
ct_src_dport_ltm    Connections from source to destination port
ct_dst_sport_ltm    Connections to destination from source port
ct_dst_src_ltm      Connections between source and destination
attack_cat          Attack category (if applicable)
label               Target classification label